level_3_description = "+3 range on ranged offensive cards, +6 AGI, +3 DEX, +5 WIS. 3 card slots. On-self: half the card's mana cost is paid as life instead. Grants Territorial Mark: a 15-damage arrow whose flight path — and the 2 squares either side of it — glistens with blue smoke for 25 tempo; enemies inside the mark are Weakened until they leave it (45 mana + 35 health, 5 tempo, range 10)."
